        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "You classify a single message from a store operator.\n\nReturn action = \"plan_cancellations\" if the operator wants to\nfind old pending orders and prepare a cancellation plan.\n\nReturn action = \"question\" if the operator is asking a question\nabout orders without asking to create a cancellation plan.\n\nReturn action = \"unclear\" if the request is ambiguous, unrelated\nto order operations, or you cannot confidently classify it.\n\nReturn days as the number of days if the user explicitly gives\na duration, such as \"5 days\" or \"older than 10 days\".\n\nNever guess the number of days. If no duration is given, leave\ndays empty. Do not cancel, modify, or approve any order."
        }
      },
